ssue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Observed a scenario similar to the following. Suppose a certain tablet had three replicas, A, B, and C.\r\n- C gets tombstoned but is still in the Raft configuration\r\n- A (the leader) receives a request to remove B from the quorum, appends it to its log, and crashes\r\n\r\nNow the tablet is stuck without a leader, because:\r\n- A has a pending config that only includes A and C, so it won't send its vote request to B when its starts an election, and C can't vote for it because the tablet is tombstoned on that replica.\r\n- B sends its vote requests to A, B, and C, but C won't vote for it (it is tombstoned), and A won't vote for it because it has a more up-to-date log.","closed_by":{"login":"bbaddepudi","id":6334739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzQ3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6334739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi","html_url":"https://github.com/bbaddepudi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/82/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte